### Variable base
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products

### 1. Consulta general (solo activos)
GET {{base}}/getAll?active=true

### 2. Consulta por ID de un producto activo
GET {{base}}/getById/1

### 3. Crear producto (201)
# Cuerpo: name, price, stock, description, brand, img, alcohol_percentage, alcohol_type
POST {{base}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ginebra Seca 750ml",
  "price": 389.5,
  "stock": 15,
  "description": "Ginebra seca con notas de enebro.",
  "brand": "Beefeater",
  "img": "ginebra-seca.jpg",
  "alcohol_percentage": 40,
  "alcohol_type": "Ginebra"
}

### 4. Actualizacion completa (cambia el 11 por el id creado en el paso 3)
PUT {{base}}/update/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ginebra London Dry 750ml",
  "price": 409.99,
  "stock": 20,
  "description": "Ginebra estilo London Dry con notas citricas.",
  "brand": "Beefeater",
  "img": "ginebra-london-dry.jpg",
  "alcohol_percentage": 40,
  "alcohol_type": "Ginebra"
}

### 5. Cambiar solo el precio
# Cuerpo: unicamente price
PATCH {{base}}/change-price/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 429.9
}

### 6. Baja logica
DELETE {{base}}/delete/11

### 7. Comprobar que ya no aparece en getAll
GET {{base}}/getAll?active=true

### 8. Comprobar que ya no aparece en getById
GET {{base}}/getById/11

### 9. ID inexistente (responde 200 con "product not found")
GET {{base}}/getById/9999

### 10. Datos invalidos: precio negativo (400)
POST {{base}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto malo",
  "price": -5,
  "stock": 1,
  "description": "Precio invalido.",
  "alcohol_percentage": 40,
  "alcohol_type": "Vodka"
}

### 11. Datos invalidos: id no numerico (400)
GET {{base}}/getById/abc

### 12. Datos invalidos: PATCH con precio en cero (400)
PATCH {{base}}/change-price/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 0
}

### 13. Datos invalidos: porcentaje de alcohol fuera de rango (400)
POST {{base}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto malo 2",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 1,
  "description": "Porcentaje invalido.",
  "alcohol_percentage": 150,
  "alcohol_type": "Vodka"
}
